\section{Testing}
\label{sec:unpaywall-testing}

Tests are distributed through this chapter, each following the code it
verifies.  The client holds a shared cache and a rate-limit clock, so before
every test we reset both---otherwise a cached DOI from one test would satisfy
the next test's lookup without hitting our mock.  The shared [[conftest]]
fixture (\cref{cache-module}) unsets every contact-email variable, so we also
set [[SCHOLAR_EMAIL]] here: without it the client is unconfigured and makes no
requests at all, which is exactly what one test checks and what every other
test must avoid.

