\subsection{Resolving a DOI to a PDF link}

The PDF module (\cref{pdf-module}) only wants one thing from Unpaywall: a URL
it can download.  Exposing that as its own verb keeps the PDF code free of the
result dictionary's shape, and routes the lookup through the same cache as
enrichment---so a DOI whose session was enriched opens without a second
request.

<<module-level oa interface>>=
def resolve_pdf_url(doi: str | None) -> str | None:
    """Return the best open-access PDF URL for ``doi``, or ``None``."""
    result = _client.fetch_oa(doi)
    if result is None:
        return None
    return result["pdf_url"]
@

